ok - GitHub green poll reports an open PR whose newest check runs are green, with its merge state
ok - a green yolo PR is merged once through the guarded merge path, and nothing else is
ok - a green PR left unmerged past the alarm window wakes once per head
ok - teardown refuses unsafe degraded and train markers before lifecycle cleanup
ok - GitHub poll emits one degraded line per failing rollup and stays silent otherwise
ok - degraded wake reads are opt-in; absent flag keeps GitHub and GitLab polls merged-only, silent, and baseline-free
